[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_9900","text":"店内广播"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0010","text":"『────那么请欣赏\n　四叶草』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_9901","text":"便利店店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0020","text":"嗯哼？\n……还不错嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0030","text":"……这边是人造花……这边是鲜花……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0040","text":"诶～～？\n完全看不出来呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0050","text":"对吧，看不出来吧！\n这么像的话，跟真的没区别了呀～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0059","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_9902","text":"路人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0060","text":"────那个，你们没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_9903","text":"路人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0070","text":"因为听到了很大的声音……\n你们是什么关系呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_9904","text":"路人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0080","text":"如果是那种情况的话，我可以叫警察……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0090","text":"！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_[s42_01890100_99_0091]","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0099","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0100","text":"————……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0110","text":"？\n日花酱……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0120","text":"……没什么…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0122","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0130","text":"啊哈哈！\n好险啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0140","text":"喂喂……\n笑过头了吧，日花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0150","text":"这就是耍帅的报应吧\n差一点就成犯罪者了哦，制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0160","text":"真是捏了把汗……\n不过多亏日花你急中生智假装是父女，帮了大忙"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0170","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0173","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0172","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0180","text":"那个……\n大崎小姐，谢谢你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0190","text":"听说你担心我们来着……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0200","text":"！　没有啦……！\n完全没那回事～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0209","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0208","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0210","text":"……日花？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0211","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0220","text":"……西装！那件，皱得太厉害了吧？\n完全看不出是工作的人啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0230","text":"哦……是吗\n哈哈，今天跑了一整天……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0232","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0231","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0240","text":"绝对不说"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_99_0250","text":"对着这满是褶皱的背"}]
